OL,3,GNEWSAShopkeepers and punters back empty
OL,4,Ashops crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FShopkeepers and punters have backed a
OL,7,Fplan to crack down on the number of
OL,8,Fempty shops in town centres.
OL,10,FLast week, Westmorland and Furness
OL,11,FCouncil approved new powers to auction
OL,12,Foff the leases of long-term vacant
OL,13,Fproperties in Barrow, Kendal, Penrith
OL,14,Fand Ulverston.
OL,16,FMavis Aitchinson, who moved to Kendal
OL,17,Fwith her husband and two toddlers in
OL,18,F1970, said "more power to their elbow"
OL,19,Fwhen it came to the council cracking
OL,20,Fdown on the empty shops.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
