OL,3,GNEWSAShopkeepers and punters back empty
OL,4,Ashops crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FKendal shopworker Sam Reynolds also
OL,7,Fthought it was a great idea, saying:
OL,8,F"The high street's dead, full of
OL,9,Fbarbers or vape shops - let's be
OL,10,Fhonest, we're all a bit sick of that,
OL,11,Faren't we?"
